---
library:
  file: ~storage/library/kinds/ARTICLE.chip
  type: chip
  class: kind
kind:
  type: ARTICLE
  letter: yes
  good: yes
  cite: yes
  auth: writer
prop:
  lines: [dek]
---
A letter with a dek and a writer. This file is the convention. Rename kind.type to change the chip TYPE. Add names to prop.lines to grow the form.
